# Flutter-related
**/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/Pods/

# Xcode-related
**/dgph
**/xcuserdata/
# Derived data from an arm64-only `xcodebuild ... -derivedDataPath ./build`.
# The default `flutter build macos` puts products in the repo-root /build/ (which
# the top-level .gitignore already covers); driving xcodebuild directly for a
# single arch - the only way it builds on macOS 26, where `lipo -verify_arch`
# rejects a universal binary - writes them here instead.
**/build/
